{title: Encouraging One Another}
{subtitle: Hebrews 10:24–25}
{key: F}
{tempo: 76}
{time: 4/4}

{comment: Intro}
| [Dm] | [C/E] | [F] | [Dm] [C/E] |
| [Bb] |

{start_of_verse: Verse 1}
[Dm]We have a great priest over [F]God's house
[Dm]Let us draw near with a true [F]heart
Full as[Gm]surance of faith [Dm7]guides us
Hearts [Bb]sprinkled clean from evil con[C]science
[Bb]Bodies washed with pure [C]water
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_chorus: Chorus}
[F]Let us [C]spur one an[Dm]other on [Bb]
[F]Toward [C]love and good [Bb]works
Not ne[Dm]glecting to meet togeth[Bb]er
But [F]encouraging one anoth[C]er
[Bb]All the more as the [C]Day draws [Dm][C/E]near [Bb]
{end_of_chorus}

{start_of_verse: Verse 2}
[Dm]Hold unwavering to our [F]hope
[Dm]For He who promised is faith[F]ful
Do not [Gm]let the habit grow
Of [Dm]neglecting our gathering time
We [Bb]need each other's [C]strength
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_chorus: Chorus}
[F]Let us [C]spur one an[Dm]other on [Bb]
[F]Toward [C]love and good [Bb]works
Not ne[Dm]glecting to meet togeth[Bb]er
But [F]encouraging one anoth[C]er
[Bb]All the more as the [C]Day draws [F]near
{end_of_chorus}

{start_of_bridge: Bridge}
[Bb]The Day is [C]drawing near to us
[F]So we press on in [C]faith
En[Bb]couraging one [C]another dai[Dm]ly
Walking in love and good [Bb]works
{end_of_bridge}

{start_of_chorus: Chorus}
[F]Let us [C]spur one an[Dm]other [Bb]on
[F]Toward [C]love and good [Bb]works
Not ne[Dm]glecting to meet togeth[Bb]er
But [F]encouraging one anoth[C]er
[Bb]All the more as the [C]Day draws [Dm][C/E]near [F]
{end_of_chorus}

{start_of_verse: Outro}
[Dm]Encourag[C/E]ing one anoth[Bb]er
As the Day draws [Dm][C/E][F]near [Dm][C/E][Bb]
{end_of_verse}
